      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beachwood%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Beachwood Historic Society runs the History Center in the former City Hall, housing a museum and archives.",
